{"3907620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VHS Bodycam", "steam_appid": 3907620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will act as an expansion of &quot;VHS Bodycam: The Torture Machine&quot; and will have longer gameplay along with more content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.poster.avif?t=1763408473\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.webm?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.mp4?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive yourself in a collection of four classified tapes that hold bodycam footage of unexplainable tragedies. You play as experts sitting behind computers who guide groups of SWAT teams, industry professionals, and experts who plunge themselves head-first into bizarre incidents to uncover the horror behind it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/30a4d1ddd97d976c54f4dc5cfb2e2561.poster.avif?t=1763408473\" width=512 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/30a4d1ddd97d976c54f4dc5cfb2e2561.webm?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/30a4d1ddd97d976c54f4dc5cfb2e2561.mp4?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor and assist your team by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remotely controlling devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyzing environments</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will act as an expansion of &quot;VHS Bodycam: The Torture Machine&quot; and will have longer gameplay along with more content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.poster.avif?t=1763408473\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.webm?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/fece89eee369dc06e57e6b3416a438b7.mp4?t=1763408473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive yourself in a collection of four classified tapes that hold bodycam footage of unexplainable tragedies. You play as experts sitting behind computers who guide groups of SWAT teams, industry professionals, and experts who plunge themselves head-first into bizarre incidents to uncover the horror behind it all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907620/extras/30a4d1ddd97d976c54f4dc5cfb2e2561.poster.avif?t=1763408473\" width=512 height=338 ><source src=\"https